# Flutter

- Use Flutter 3.47+ / Dart 3.13 patterns already on this machine.
- Prefer `flutter create` / existing package layout over custom trees.
- UI: widgets + named constructors; extract widgets instead of giant `build`.
- State: Riverpod (chosen). See `flutter-riverpod` skill for provider conventions. Do not layer Bloc/GetX/Provider package on top.
- Talk to FastAPI via a small API client (Dio or `http`), base URL from config/env — not hardcoded production hosts.
- Android emulator: use `10.0.2.2` to reach host `localhost`. Chrome/web: `http://127.0.0.1:<port>`.
- Run `flutter analyze` after non-trivial Dart changes.
